      "hz004": "清河坊历史文化街区 — cultural old street, mixed indoor/outdoor, low walking intensity, ~2 hours recommended; good for evening exploration and food.",
      "hz001": "西湖风景名胜区 — iconic cultural/natural site, outdoor-heavy, medium walking, ~4 hours recommended; conditional in rain/high heat.",
      "hz003": "西溪国家湿地公园 — nature/eco wetland with boats, outdoor-heavy, ~4 hours recommended; conditional in rain/high heat."
