        "day": 1,
        "date": "2026-08-23",
        "attraction_poi_ids": [
          "hz002",
          "hz004"
        ],
        "notes": "Morning: Lingyin & Feilai Peak (hz002) — allocated ~3 hours for temples and stone carvings; weather-resilient option. Afternoon/Evening: Qinghefang Historical Cultural Street (hz004) — leisure stroll, snacks, and cultural shopping; low walking intensity, suitable for evening when temperatures drop."
