        "attraction_poi_ids": [
          "hz001",
          "hz003"
        ],
        "notes": "Morning: West Lake Scenic Area (hz001) — recommended early morning visit (~4 hours) to enjoy cooler temperatures; include lakeside viewing and short boat or promenades. Afternoon: Xixi National Wetland Park (hz003) — ecological wetland and boat options (~4 hours); consider boat/tour to reduce outdoor walking in heat. Swap order with West Lake if weather forecasts indicate afternoon improvement."
